{"sections":[{"slug":"线丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"线丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">线丛</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"线丛"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">代数几何</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环化空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环化空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(X,A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">线丛</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是指秩为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的局部自由</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">分类</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">复流形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全纯线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全纯线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">被</span> $H^1(X,\\mathcal O_X^\\times)$ <span lang=\"zh\">分类</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为给定线丛无非是给定一些转移函数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而这些转移函数构成</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上圈</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Čech上同调","text":"Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与除子的关系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">除子</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的线丛</span> $\\mathcal O_X(D)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">允许在</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有奇点</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的函数层</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">是光滑除子</span>, $\\mathcal O_D$ <span lang=\"zh\">是其正则函数层</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">正合列</span>\n$$\r\n0 \\to \\mathcal O_X(-D) \\to \\mathcal O_X \\to \\mathcal O_D\\to 0\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">诱导的长正合列给出</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Euler示性数","text":"Euler <span lang=\"zh\">示性数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的加性</span>\n$$\r\n\\chi(\\mathcal O_X(-D)) + \\chi(\\mathcal O_D) = \\chi(\\mathcal O_X).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">某种意义上可将</span> $\\mathcal O_D$ <span lang=\"zh\">看成</span> $\\mathcal O_X$ <span lang=\"zh\">和</span> $\\mathcal O_X(-D)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的差</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/除子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">除子</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">第一</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">给出了</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的复线丛与</span> $H^2(X,\\mathbb{Z})$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素的一一对应</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且将张量积对应到上同调类的和</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}